RESPONSIBILITIES:
&#8226; Meet and exceed assigned targets for profitable sales objectives in assigned congresses;
&#8226; Proactively assess, clarify, and validate customer needs;
&#8226; Establish productive, professional relationships with key personnel while prospecting for new ones;
&#8226; Plan sales strategy for each project, develop Industry Prospectus and manage all partnerships including soliciting, creating/responding to offers with proposals;
&#8226; Be the main contact and act as liaison between companies and project teams for your assigned congresses;
&#8226; Proactively provide reports to the Senior Account Manager, project teams, and clients;
&#8226; Conduct successful negotiations with clients;
&#8226; Attract industry representatives as delegates to assigned congresses;
Industry Operations:
&#8226; Collect, coordinate and ensure delivery of sponsors&#8217; requirements;
&#8226; Liaise in the relationship between the client and the internal counterparts;
&#8226; Manage the communication and orders from the exhibitors and sponsors.
REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS:
&#8226; 2-3 years of sales experience, Industry Liaison & Sales;
&#8226; Previous work experience in an international environment with global offices/markets;
&#8226; Excellent computer skills;
&#8226; Target and results oriented;
&#8226; Direct, honest communication style;
&#8226; Exceptional client/interpersonal skills &#8211; written, verbal and presentation;
&#8226; Sales Force & WordPress skills &#8211; an advantage;
&#8226; Professional level of English;
&#8226; Bachelor&#8217;s degree in related discipline;
&#8226; Availability for moderate travel (3-5 times per year). What we offer- Madrid
Real opportunities for professional development in a leading international company
Friendly team culture that promotes initial and continual professional education and team collaboration
Hybrid model & Flexible working hours
Extra remote working days / weeks
Flexible remuneration: food, transportation, daycare
Easy access by public transport (really close by a metro stop)
